//- 0:00 TITLE, then 0:15 WORDS THAT DON'T TRANSLATE. Straight in: no hello, no who-am-I. docs/TALK.md has the run.

section.cover(data-timing="15")
  p.a-talk-by a talk by #{authorHandle}
  h1= talkTitle
  aside.notes
    ul
      li Straight in. Every second before 4:00 counts toward the vote.

+gag("Swatches for colors only Spanish has a word for: trigueño, zarco, güero, celeste. Unverified, see docs/TALK.md, Swatch candidates.")(data-timing="30")
  h2 Only in Spanish
  aside.notes
    ul
      li Colors of particular things: skin, eyes, hair, water.
      li Check every word with a native speaker from Spain before it ships.

+gag("Swatches for colors only English has a word for: teal, hazel, auburn, tan, periwinkle. Unverified, see docs/TALK.md, Swatch candidates.")(data-timing="30")
  h2 Only in English
  aside.notes
    ul
      li Spanish needs two words for most of these.

section.statement(data-timing="15")
  h2 What does that say about us?
  p.aside (hold that thought)
  aside.notes
    ul
      li Leave it hanging. The denouement answers it.
